# IMPORTANT: The following files MUST be committed for deployment:
# ✅ package.json (dependencies list)
# ✅ package-lock.json (exact versions - CRITICAL for DigitalOcean!)
# ✅ tsconfig.json (TypeScript config)
# ✅ next.config.js (Next.js config)
# ✅ tailwind.config.ts (Tailwind config)
# ✅ postcss.config.js (PostCSS config)
# ✅ .env.local.example (environment template, NOT .env.local!)
# ✅ .do/ directory (DigitalOcean deployment config)
# ✅ src/ directory (all source code)
# ✅ public/ directory (static assets, icons, manifest)
